                ],
                [
                    85.0,
                    402.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "B. Purpose",
            "block_bbox": [
                49,
                414,
                157,
                438
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    49.0,
                    414.0
                ],
                [
                    155.99998474121094,
                    414.0
                ],
                [
                    155.99998474121094,
                    437.0
                ],
                [
                    49.0,
                    437.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. The purpose of this procedure is to secure, at the lowest possible administrative level, equitable solutions to the problems which may occur in the administration of this Agreement. Both parties agree that these proceedings will be kept informal and confidential at all levels of the procedure.",
            "block_bbox": [
                87,
                445,
                703,
                544
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    87.0,
                    445.0
                ],
                [
                    703.0,
                    445.0
                ],
                [
                    703.0,
                    544.0
                ],
                [
                    87.0,
                    544.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. Nothing herein contained shall be construed as limiting the right of any unit member having a grievance to discuss the matter with any appropriate members of the administration. Such grievance may be adjusted without intervention of the Council, providing that the adjustment is not inconsistent with the terms of this Agreement.",
            "block_bbox": [
                85,
                555,
                703,
                676
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    85.0,
                    555.0
                ],
                [
                    703.0,
                    555.0
                ],
                [
                    703.0,
                    676.0
                ],
                [
                    85.0,
                    676.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. No grievance shall be initiated more than fifteen (15) duty days after the cause has occurred or should have been discovered.",
            "block_bbox": [
                87,
                688,
                703,
                737
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    87.0,
                    688.0
                ],
                [
                    703.0,
                    688.0
                ],
                [
                    703.0,
                    737.0
                ],
                [
                    87.0,
                    737.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. A grievance shall be automatically waived and shall not be subject to further discussion or appeal if the grievant does not process it within any of the stated time limits. Such time limits may only be extended by mutual agreement between the parties.",
            "block_bbox": [
                85,
                749,
                704,
                848
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    85.0,
                    749.0
                ],
                [
                    704.0,
                    749.0
                ],
                [
                    704.0,
                    848.0
                ],
                [
                    85.0,
                    848.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "C. A covered unit member will first discuss his/her grievance with his/her immediate supervisor. Both parties will make efforts to solve the grievance at this informal level.",
            "block_bbox": [
                49,
                859,
                704,
                931
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 11,
            "group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    49.0,
                    859.0
                ],
                [
                    704.0,
                    859.0
                ],
                [
                    704.0,
                    931.0
                ],
                [
                    49.0,
                    931.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "D. Step One—If the grievance cannot be solved at the informal level, the unit member then submits the grievance to his/her appropriate administrator in writing within fifteen (15) duty days after the grievance arises. If the appropriate administrator does not satisfy it within ten (10) duty days from receipt of the written grievance, the grievance may be processed to Step Two.",
            "block_bbox": [
                48,
                944,
                704,
                1067
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 12,
            "group_id": 11,
